{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.sandwich_offdiagonal_qzero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.sandwich_offdiagonal_qzero","kind":"theorem","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesQZeroDTCount.lean#L102-L104","doc":"The q→0 sandwich `(0,1)` entry is `-6`; combined with the `-½` normalization\nthis is the constant `3`. Records the numeric link. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.stokes_qzero_offdiagonal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.stokes_qzero_offdiagonal","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesQZeroDTCount.lean#L97-L100","doc":"**The q→0 Stokes/DT constant is `3`.** Reading the extracted `S⁺(0)`, its\n`(0,1)` entry (the figure-eight DT invariant governing the geometric Borel\nsingularity at `ω = Vol(4₁)/π`) is `3`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.ggm_sandwich_qzero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.ggm_sandwich_qzero","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesQZeroDTCount.lean#L89-L95","doc":"**The q→0 GGM sandwich yields the integer 3.** Every entry of the eq-(59a)\nproduct `A·W₋₁·B·W₋₁ᵀ·C` at q→0 equals `-2·S⁺(0)` with `S⁺(0)=[[1,3],[0,1]]`.\nSo `S⁺(0) = -½·(A·W₋₁(0)·B·W₋₁(0)ᵀ·C)`, and its off-diagonal — the DT/Stokes\nconstant `A_ω` at the semiclassical limit — is exactly `3`. Decidable integer\narithmetic; not an assumption. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.detW0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.detW0","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesQZeroDTCount.lean#L86-L87","doc":"**GGM Theorem 9 at q→0.** `det W₋₁(0) = 2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.sandwich","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.sandwich","kind":"def","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesQZeroDTCount.lean#L83-L84","doc":"The eq-(59a) sandwich `A·W₋₁·B·W₋₁ᵀ·C` at q→0. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.Splus0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.Splus0","kind":"def","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesQZeroDTCount.lean#L80-L81","doc":"The extracted q→0 Stokes matrix, GGM eq 60: `S⁺(0) = [[1,3],[0,1]]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.Cmat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.Cmat","kind":"def","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesQZeroDTCount.lean#L76-L78","doc":"Glyph-verified GGM eq-(59a) integer matrix `C` (magnitude `[[0,1],[1,2]]`,\nsign row fixed by the q→0 filter). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.Bmat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.Bmat","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesQZeroDTCount.lean#L73-L74","doc":"Glyph-verified GGM eq-(59a) integer matrix `B` (the swap, `[[0,1],[1,0]]`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.Amat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.Amat","kind":"def","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesQZeroDTCount.lean#L70-L71","doc":"Glyph-verified GGM eq-(59a) integer matrix `A` (magnitude `[[0,1],[1,1]]`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.W0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.W0","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesQZeroDTCount.lean#L65-L68","doc":"The q→0 evaluation of the GGM fundamental-solution matrix `W₋₁` for 4₁,\ncomputed exactly from the integer q-series `G⁰_m, G¹_m` (GGM eqs 51a/51b):\n`G⁰₋₁(0)=0, G¹₋₁(0)=-2, G⁰₀(0)=1, G¹₀(0)=1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.det","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.det","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesQZeroDTCount.lean#L62-L63","doc":"Explicit `2×2` integer determinant. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.tr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.tr","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesQZeroDTCount.lean#L59-L60","doc":"Explicit `2×2` transpose. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.mul","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesQZeroDTCount.lean#L56-L57","doc":"Explicit `2×2` integer-matrix product (no Mathlib `Matrix` dependency). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.M2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StokesQZeroDTCount.M2","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StokesQZeroDTCount.lean#L53-L54","doc":"A `2×2` integer matrix as an explicit function of its indices. ","signatureChunk":0}]}